<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>假热假寒 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%81%87%E7%83%AD%E5%81%87%E5%AF%92/</link><description>Recent content in 假热假寒 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 10:11:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%81%87%E7%83%AD%E5%81%87%E5%AF%92/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>真治法：论真热真寒</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-14-zhenzhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 10:10:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-14-zhenzhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“真治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;真热与真寒&lt;/strong&gt;的辨证与正治法则。与“假治法”相对，真治法针对寒热本质与表象一致的病证，&lt;strong&gt;直接以寒治热、以热治寒&lt;/strong&gt;，不须反佐巧服。</description></item><item><title>假治法：论假热假寒</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-13-jiazhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 09:22:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-13-jiazhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“假治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;真寒假热、真热假寒&lt;/strong&gt;等寒热真假错杂证的辨识与治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;以假治假，顺其假象而引药直达病所&lt;/strong&gt;。真寒假热者，热药冷服，佐苦寒之品为向导；真热假寒者，寒药热服，佐辛热之品为先锋。</description></item></channel></rss>